OL,3,GNEWSAStepdad guilty of murdering
OL,4,Astudent on her birthday
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis article contains distressing
OL,7,Fdetails.
OL,9,FA man who was "sexually obsessed" with
OL,10,Fhis stepdaughter has been found guilty
OL,11,Fof murdering her at her university flat
OL,12,Fon her 20th birthday.
OL,14,FNathan Owens, 34, from Hartlepool,
OL,15,Fkilled Carla Georgescu in her room at
OL,16,Fher halls of residence in Preston in
OL,17,FFebruary and then staged the scene to
OL,18,Fmake it look like she had taken her own
OL,19,Flife.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
