OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trial at Preston Crown Court
OL,7,Fpreviously heard Owens had secretly
OL,8,Ftaken photographs of Carla and
OL,9,Fsuperimposed her face on to naked
OL,10,Fpornographic images of women.
